Additionally, ServiceNow maintains a continuous control monitoring (CCM) program to evaluate the performance 
of specific control activities and processes at certain intervals based on risk and frequency of the control activity.  
The CCM program allows ServiceNow management to oversee the current state of monitored controls on a frequent 
